WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open OpStack intelligence questions in Course builder or Add a block → Knowledge checks.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.500
Step 2: Choose written course content, accessible Knowledge Library articles or pasted text, then inspect the selected source.

3
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:19.625
Step 3: Choose question types and a count large enough for each selected type. Generate and review questions and answers.

4
00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:27.083
Step 4: Choose Add questions to course to insert editable draft questions, then verify and publish through the normal course workflow.
